---
import { path } from '@/i18n';
import { site } from '@/config/site';
const mail = site.contactEmail;
---
<p>These terms apply when you visit the Encore website or join the early-access waitlist. By using the site, you agree to them.</p>

<h2>About Encore</h2>
<p>Encore is an app for finding, saving and keeping track of concerts. It has not launched yet. This website introduces the app and lets you join a waitlist for early access.</p>

<h2>The waitlist</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Joining is free and you can leave at any time by emailing <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a>.</li>
  <li>A place on the waitlist does not guarantee access by a specific date, or at all. We decide how and when early access is offered.</li>
  <li>Please only sign up with an email address you own or are allowed to use.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Previews on this site</h2>
<p>The screens shown on this website are previews of the app in development. Artists, venues, dates and other details in them are examples, and the final app may look and work differently.</p>

<h2>Tickets and third parties</h2>
<p>Encore will link to ticket sellers and other websites we do not run. Purchases you make there are between you and that seller, under their terms.</p>

<h2>Acceptable use</h2>
<p>Do not misuse the site: no attempts to disrupt it, gain unauthorised access, submit addresses automatically or sign up other people without their permission.</p>

<h2>Intellectual property</h2>
<p>The Encore name, logo, design and content of this website belong to Encore. You may not copy or reuse them without our written permission.</p>

<h2>Liability</h2>
<p>We work to keep this site accurate and available, but it is provided as it is, without warranties. To the extent the law allows, Encore is not liable for losses arising from your use of the site. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under consumer law.</p>

<h2>Privacy</h2>
<p>How we handle your email address is explained in our <a href={path('privacy', 'en')}>Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may update these terms as Encore develops. The date at the top of this page shows when they last changed.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a>.</p>
